82.3\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> 169. <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"141\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 140.7 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 25.4 25.4 32.2 40.4 61.4 72.0 78.7 78.7 86.2 105.7 110.2 117.7 117.7\" y=\"25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"16.4 25.4 32.2 40.4 61.4 86.2 110.2 124.4\" y=\"25.4 20.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 20.3 25.4\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> ne de Cehennem yolundan başka bir tarika hidayet etmesi ihtimali yokdur. Ya'ni bunlar «<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"213\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 213.4 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 3.0 9.7 9.7 25.4 36.7 44.3 44.3 56.3 56.3 72.0 72.0 82.4 98.3 98.3 105.7 105.7 112.4 112.4 119.3 135.0 156.0 162.7 162.7 162.7 169.4 177.0 192.7 192.7 203.3 203.3\" y=\"25.6 26.3 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"25.4 36.7 82.4 119.3 139.4 156.0 192.7\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » hukmüne tâbi'dirler. <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"161\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 161.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 23.3 23.3 23.3 32.3 39.0 54.7 54.7 61.6 69.7 76.6 76.6 92.3 102.7 109.6 109.6 118.6 118.6 126.0\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 26.3 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"32.3 39.0 61.6 92.3 132.7 132.7 144.7\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> Cehennemde müebbeden kalacaklardır. Bu kadar azgın kâfirler nasıl mağlûb edilirler de Cehenneme tıkılırlar? Diye istib'ade de mahal yokdur. Çünkü<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"234\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 233.8 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 23.3 23.3 30.7 37.6 39.7